  r:"Turki is planning a trip with his family. First, they are going to drive to AlUla. They are going to see the old rock tombs at Hegra, which are more than two thousand years old. Then they are going to sleep in a desert camp. Turki's sister wants to see the Elephant Rock at sunset. Turki is going to take his new camera, because he wants to make a short video about the trip for his class.",
