  r:"Sea turtles have lived on Earth for more than one hundred million years, but today many of them are in danger. They often eat plastic bags because they look like jellyfish. Also, bright lights on beaches confuse baby turtles, so they walk away from the sea. Volunteers now clean beaches, turn off lights at night and help the babies reach the water safely.",
