  r:"Coach Majed has three golden rules for his team. Rule one: You must always respect your teammates and the other team. Rule two: You mustn't give up, even if you are losing. Rule three: You must enjoy the game. 'Winning is nice,' he says, 'but learning and having fun are more important.' His team doesn't always win, but everyone loves playing for him.",
